  "html": "<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:302px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Sam2.jpg\" title=\"Sam from Sam's Dungeon Wholesale\"><img alt=\"Sam from Sam's Dungeon Wholesale\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"219\" src=\"/images/Sam2.jpg\" width=\"300\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/Sam2.jpg\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>Sam from Sam's Dungeon Wholesale</div></div></div>\n<p><br/>\nSam can be found on level 4 and level 7 dungeons, with exceptions for Dew Valley, Algernon and HDoL where he doesnt spawn.  He is a vendor that only accepts King's Coins as payment for items that are class specific.  That is to say, that if he is offering helms, then the he will sell them as Fighter Helms, Mage Helms and Ranger Helms.  However, like the Token Masters, that is the only choice you have. The particular item will be random.\n</p><p>The additional caveat is that the items sold will be of the buyer's level and immediately soulbound.  In addition, the offerings are subject to the recommended level limits for the dungeon he is found in.  For example, Sam's offerings if found in <a href=\"/wiki/The_Widower's_Nest\" title=\"The Widower's Nest\">The Widower's Nest</a> would be Level 20-40.  A level 41 character would be unable to purchase from this particular Sam.\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n<table class=\"toc\" id=\"toc\" summary=\"Contents\"><tr><td><div id=\"toctitle\"><h2>Contents</h2></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1\"><a href=\"#Unique_Sam\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Unique Sam</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1\"><a href=\"#Mythic_Sam\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Mythic Sam</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2\"><a href=\"#Confirmed_Sightings_with_Build.23:\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Confirmed Sightings with Build#:</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1\"><a href=\"#Quotes\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Quotes</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n\n</td></tr></table>\n<a name=\"Unique_Sam\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Unique Sam</span></h2>\n<p>This version of Sam is a merchant who sells purple/unique <a href=\"/wiki/Items\" title=\"Items\">items</a> for <a href=\"/wiki/Kings_Coins\" title=\"Kings Coins\">Kings Coins</a>.  There is a 1 in 4 chance that Unique Sam will appear on these levels and there is a rumored 1/300 chance that Unique Sam will sell a Mythic/Rainbow item instead of a purple/unique item.\n</p>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"text-align:left;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tr>\n<td valign=\"top\">\n<table align=\"left\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"text-align:left;\">\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\">The following are lists of the amount of <a href=\"/wiki/Kings_Coins\" title=\"Kings Coins\">Kings Coins</a> needed for each Unique Item type:<br/>\n</td><td> \n</td><td>The following is a list of what offerings are available and their locations:\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td valign=\"top\">\n<table align=\"left\" border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"text-align:center; width:100%; background:rgb(240,240,240);\">\n<tr>\n<th style=\"background:#9999FF\">Item\n</th><th style=\"background:#9999FF\">Cost\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Boots </td><td>9 KC's\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Body Armor </td><td>18 KC's\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Gloves </td><td>9 KC's\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1-handed Weapons </td><td> 9 KC's\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Jewelry </td><td>12 KC's\n</td></tr></table>\n</td><td valign=\"top\">\n<table align=\"left\" border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"text-align:center; width:100%; background:rgb(240,240,240);\">\n<tr>\n<th style=\"background:#9999FF\">Item\n</th><th style=\"background:#9999FF\">Cost\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Shoulders </td><td>9 KC's\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Shields </td><td> 9 KC's\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Helms </td><td>9 KC's\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2-handed Weapons </td><td> 18 KC's\n</td></tr></table>\n</td><td valign=\"top\"> \n</td><td valign=\"top\">\n<table align=\"left\" border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"text-align:center; width:100%; background:rgb(240,240,240);\">\n<tr>\n<th style=\"background:#9999FF\">Items\n</th><th style=\"background:#9999FF\">Location\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Boots, Gloves &amp; Shoulders </td><td> Level 4\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1-handed Weapons &amp; Shields </td><td>Level 4\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Helms &amp; Body Armor </td><td>Level 7\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2-handed Weapons &amp; Jewelry </td><td>Level 7\n</td></tr></table>\n</td></tr></table>\n</td></tr></table>\n<a name=\"Mythic_Sam\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\"> Mythic Sam </span></h2>\n<p>This version of Sam is a merchant who sells Mythic/Rainbow <a href=\"/wiki/Items\" title=\"Items\">items</a> for <a href=\"/wiki/Kings_Coins\" title=\"Kings Coins\">Kings Coins</a>.  There is a rumored 1/300 chance that Mythic Sam will appear on these levels.  When found, Mythic Sam will offer only one type of class specific armor.  His Mythic offerings as of Build 100 correspond to those he would carry as Unique Sam.  That is to say, if searching for Mythic Sam carrying gloves, search level 4 of a particular dungeon; if searching for body armor, search level 7.\n</p>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"text-align:left;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tr>\n<td width=\"40%\">\n<table align=\"left\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"text-align:left;\">\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\">As of Build 100: The following are lists of the amount of <a href=\"/wiki/Kings_Coins\" title=\"Kings Coins\">Kings Coins</a> needed for each Mythic Item type:<br/>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td valign=\"top\">\n<table align=\"left\" border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"text-align:center; width:100%; background:rgb(240,240,240);\">\n<tr>\n<th style=\"background:#9999FF\">Item\n</th><th style=\"background:#9999FF\">Cost\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Boots </td><td>100 KC's\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Body Armor </td><td>200 KC's\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Gloves </td><td>100 KC's\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1-handed Weapons </td><td>100 KC's\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Jewelry </td><td>140 KC's\n</td></tr></table>\n</td><td valign=\"top\">\n<table align=\"left\" border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"text-align:center; width:100%; background:rgb(240,240,240);\">\n<tr>\n<th style=\"background:#9999FF\">Item\n</th><th style=\"background:#9999FF\">Cost\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Shoulders </td><td>100 KC's\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Shields </td><td>100 KC's\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Helms </td><td>100 KC's\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2-handed Weapons </td><td>200 KC's\n</td></tr></table>\n</td></tr></table>\n</td><td> \n</td></tr></table>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"text-align:left;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tr>\n<td width=\"100%\">\n<a name=\"Confirmed_Sightings_with_Build.23:\"></a><h4> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Confirmed Sightings with Build#:</span></h4>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td valign=\"top\">\n<table align=\"left\" border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"text-align:center; width:100%; background:rgb(240,240,240);\">\n<tr>\n<th style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"11%\">Mythic Item\n</th><th style=\"background:#9999FF\">Dungeon<br/> Level\n</th><th style=\"background:#9999FF\"><a href=\"/wiki/Algor's_Terror-Dome\" title=\"Algor's Terror-Dome\">Algor's</a>\n</th><th style=\"background:#9999FF\"><a href=\"/wiki/Vergrim's_Vexation\" title=\"Vergrim's Vexation\">Vexation</a>\n</th><th style=\"background:#9999FF\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Widower's_Nest\" title=\"The Widower's Nest\">Widower's</a>\n</th><th style=\"background:#9999FF\"><a href=\"/wiki/Frump's_Misfortune\" title=\"Frump's Misfortune\">Frump's</a>\n</th><th style=\"background:#9999FF\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Mutanous_Malaise\" title=\"The Mutanous Malaise\">Mutanous</a>\n</th><th style=\"background:#9999FF\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Embercore_Path\" title=\"The Embercore Path\">Embercore</a>\n</th><th style=\"background:#9999FF\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Shadow's_Embrace\" title=\"The Shadow's Embrace\">Shadow's</a>\n</th><th style=\"background:#9999FF\"><a href=\"/wiki/Balzack's_Burrow\" title=\"Balzack's Burrow\">Balzack's</a>\n</th><th style=\"background:#9999FF\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ratsputin's_Gulag\" title=\"Ratsputin's Gulag\">Ratsputin's</a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"background:#9999FF\">Boots\n</th><td width=\"7%\">4\n</td><td width=\"7%\"> \n</td><td width=\"7%\"> \n</td><td width=\"7%\">B.110\n</td><td width=\"7%\"> \n</td><td width=\"7%\"> \n</td><td width=\"7%\"> \n</td><td width=\"7%\">B.100\n</td><td width=\"7%\"> \n</td><td width=\"7%\"> \n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"background:#9999FF\">Gloves\n</th><td width=\"7%\">4\n</td><td width=\"7%\"> \n</td><td width=\"7%\"> \n</td><td width=\"7%\">B.100\n</td><td width=\"7%\"> \n</td><td width=\"7%\"> \n</td><td width=\"7%\"> \n</td><td width=\"7%\"> \n</td><td width=\"7%\"> \n</td><td width=\"7%\"> \n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"background:#9999FF\">Shoulders\n</th><td width=\"7%\">4\n</td><td width=\"7%\"> \n</td><td width=\"7%\"> \n</td><td width=\"7%\"> \n</td><td width=\"7%\"> \n</td><td width=\"7%\"> \n</td><td width=\"7%\">B.100\n</td><td width=\"7%\"> \n</td><td width=\"7%\"> \n</td><td width=\"7%\"> \n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"background:#9999FF\">1-handed Weapons\n</th><td width=\"7%\">4\n</td><td width=\"7%\">B.100\n</td><td width=\"7%\"> \n</td><td width=\"7%\">B.137\n</td><td width=\"7%\"> \n</td><td width=\"7%\">B.100\n</td><td width=\"7%\">B.100\n</td><td width=\"7%\"> \n</td><td width=\"7%\"> \n</td><td width=\"7%\"> \n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"background:#9999FF\">Shields\n</th><td width=\"7%\">4\n</td><td width=\"7%\"> \n</td><td width=\"7%\"> \n</td><td width=\"7%\"> \n</td><td width=\"7%\"> \n</td><td width=\"7%\"> \n</td><td width=\"7%\">B.138\n</td><td width=\"7%\"> \n</td><td width=\"7%\">B.110\n</td><td width=\"7%\"> \n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"11\"> \n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"background:#9999FF\">Helms\n</th><td width=\"7%\">7\n</td><td width=\"7%\"> \n</td><td width=\"7%\"> \n</td><td width=\"7%\"> \n</td><td width=\"7%\"> \n</td><td width=\"7%\"> \n</td><td width=\"7%\">B.131\n</td><td width=\"7%\">B.137\n</td><td width=\"7%\">B.110\n</td><td width=\"7%\">B.110\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"background:#9999FF\">Body Armor\n</th><td width=\"7%\">7\n</td><td width=\"7%\"> \n</td><td width=\"7%\"> \n</td><td width=\"7%\"> \n</td><td width=\"7%\"> \n</td><td width=\"7%\"> \n</td><td width=\"7%\">B.131\n</td><td width=\"7%\">B.110\n</td><td width=\"7%\"> \n</td><td width=\"7%\"> \n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"background:#9999FF\">2-handed Weapons\n</th><td width=\"7%\">7\n</td><td width=\"7%\"> \n</td><td width=\"7%\"> \n</td><td width=\"7%\"> \n</td><td width=\"7%\"> \n</td><td width=\"7%\"> \n</td><td width=\"7%\"> \n</td><td width=\"7%\">B.100\n</td><td width=\"7%\"> \n</td><td width=\"7%\"> \n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"background:#9999FF\">Jewelry\n</th><td width=\"7%\">7\n</td><td width=\"7%\"> \n</td><td width=\"7%\"> \n</td><td width=\"7%\"> \n</td><td width=\"7%\"> \n</td><td width=\"7%\"> \n</td><td width=\"7%\">B.100\n</td><td width=\"7%\">B.100\n</td><td width=\"7%\"> \n</td><td width=\"7%\">B.100\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n</td></tr></table>\n<a name=\"Quotes\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Quotes</span></h2>\n<p><i>\"Deals, deals, deals!\"</i> (build 110)\n</p><p><i>\"(mumbles something) Hey! Who said that?\"</i> (build 110)\n</p><p><i>\"Hey, there!\"</i> (build 110)\n</p><p><i>\"Hi, there!\"</i> (build 110)\n</p><p><i>\"How are you?\"</i> (build 110)\n</p><p><i>\"I'm practically giving it away!\"</i> (build 110)\n</p><p><i>\"If you don't like it, bring it back for a full refund! (whispers something unintelligible)\"</i> (build 110)\n</p><p><i>\"It's a swell day here in this deep, dark dungeon!\"</i> (build 110)\n</p><p><i>\"It's good to see you!\"</i> (build 110)\n</p><p><i>\"Look what I have for sale today!</i>\" (build 110)\n</p><p><i>\"Shop early, shop often\"</i> (build 110)\n</p><p><i>\"Thanks for shopping.\"</i> (build 110)\n</p><p><i>\"Thanks for shopping at Sam's Dungeon Wholesale.\"</i> (build 110)\n</p><p><i>\"Thanks for shopping with Sam. Remember, who's the man with the cheap goods? Sam.\\\"</i> (build 110)\n</p><p><i>\"This is a real steal!\"</i> (build 110)\n</p><p><i>\"You have a great day!\"</i> (build 110)\n</p>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
}
